# expect: accept
# Exactly 48 channels (the maximum): all 7 IMU fields plus 41 module channels.
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 4 -> 4*95 = 380 bit/s; groups m1g0@100, m1g1@50, m1g2@20, m1g3@10, m2g0@10, m2g1@10, m2g2@10, m2g3@10, m3g0@10, m3g1@10, m3g2@10, m3g3@10, m4g0@10, m4g1@10
# CAN: sum of group rates 280 Hz -> 280*135 = 37800 bit/s; total 38180 bit/s = 7.636 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 1180 Hz -> 11.8 samples per 10 ms frame -> 1 packet(s); 9*11.8 + 1*(22+4+66) = 198.2 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 158560 bit/s (limit 2000000)
iqk-plan 1
campaign blind1_c01
channel imu_gyro_x imu:gyro_x rate=50
